            <title>0.15.3</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:15:57 +0530</pubDate>
            <link>https://www.wakebee.app</link>
            <sparkle:version>30</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>WakeBee 0.15.3</title><h1>WakeBee 0.15.3</h1><ul><li>A green dot replaces the menu-bar countdown and On text.</li><li>Compact, content-sized session panels and smaller Settings. Quit is directly accessible.</li><li>Closed-lid setup enables the mode after successful macOS approval. Battery use can be configured in one place.</li><li>Helper registration no longer blocks the UI thread, and idle background work is reduced.</li></ul><p>Battery, heat, time, and connection safeguards remain active. End your session and keep the lid open during installation. Versions 0.14 and earlier require a one-time manual migration.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/jswladitya/WakeBee-Releases/releases/tag/v0.15.3">Installation and migration instructions</a></p></html>
]]></description>
